# Anoint with Affliction: "Corrupted - Exile that creature instead if its controller has three or more poison counters."
# Bot1's Glistener Elf (infect) hits Bot2 once a turn on turns 3, 5 and 7. On turn 5 Bot2 has two poison counters, one
# short: Anoint on Bot2's Argothian Elder (mana value 4) does nothing. On turn 7 Bot2 has three, exactly enough: the Elder
# is exiled whatever its mana value. Bot1's own Argothian Elder (mana value 4) is then Anointed too: it is its controller,
# Bot1, who has no poison counters, that matters, not the opponent's, so it survives (CR 122.1f, 608.2h).

